          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 2072019856}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang Ikatlong bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa El filibusterismo. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 21 hanggang 30
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 997482085}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2127840884}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1108014679}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1108014679}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa ikatlong antas ng ating paglalakbay sa El Filibusterismo, mas
            tumitindi ang tunggalian sa pagitan ng kapangyarihan at katarungan. Makikita
            rito ang pag-usbong ng damdamin ng paghihiganti, ang pagkabigo ng sistema,
            at ang pagkamulat ng mga mamamayan sa tunay na mukha ng lipunan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 997482085}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2127840884}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1108014679}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 57360de52243da94ca1657914b216ca0, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa mga kabanatang ito, ipinakita ni Rizal ang mithiin ng mga kabataan
            na magkaroon ng sariling akademya o paaralan. Ngunit ang kanilang mga
            pangarap ay binigo ng mga nasa kapangyarihan, na takot sa pagbabagong
            dulot ng edukasyon. Ang eksenang ito ay sumisimbolo sa pagkamulat ng
            kabataan at sa pagsisimula ng panawagan para sa pagbabago.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 478cd0decb23dbd47806fd9cccec6c55, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: "Sa puntong ito, mas lumalalim ang galit ni Simoun sa lipunan. Ang
            kanyang kayamanan at impluwensya ay ginamit hindi para sa kabutihan,
            kundi upang wasakin ang sistemang mapang-api. Ipinakita ni Rizal ang
            panganib ng paghihiganting walang katarungan\u2014na minsan, ang apoy
            ng galit ay nagiging apoy ng kapahamakan."
        - characterObj: {fileID: 2072019856}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: a718a87e451c8c642961f2226bf7a32a, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Isagani ay sumisimbolo sa kabataang matatag sa prinsipyo. Kahit
            sa harap ng tukso ng paghihiganti, pinili niya ang tama. Sa pamamagitan
            niya, ipinakita ni Rizal na ang tunay na pagbabago ay hindi nagmumula
            sa galit, kundi sa kabutihang-loob at pag-asa sa bayan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 997482085}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2127840884}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
